      "created_at": "2013-04-13T20:25:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Welcome to the Multiverse and welcome to the community! As you've noticed, this is a really great game, and the more you play, the more you'll love it. Feel free to poke around on the forums, and feel free to ask lots of questions. The game has a lot of nuanced rules, and it feel like every other game I play has some unique card interaction that I feel compelled to check and see if I handled it right.</p>",
